docs/

# A screen capture lands in whatever directory is focused, which can be this
# package — and it captures whatever the window was showing. Ignore the default
# names so a raw, unredacted screenshot can never be swept into a commit by an
# untargeted `git add`. Ship the ones you mean to publish by naming them.
屏幕截图*.png
Screenshot*.png
